 <h3><u>Rashke Maryam naaze Saara Sayyeda</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>rashke maryam naze sara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> hum ko yeh maalum hai jannat me bhi<br> aap hi kaa hai ijaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> hauslaa zainab ka allaho ghani<br> aa gayi jaise dubaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<span class=text_exposed_show><br> <br> rotiyo par aapki hai aajtak<br> arsh walo ka guzara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> aate aate aapke darbaar tak<br> bhar gaya daaman humaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> dono aalam me nahi jiski misaal<br> aisa qunbaa hai tumhaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> ghar mei haider k hua jalwaa figan<br> teri kismat ka sitaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> baadshaho ne teri aulaad se<br> maanga bakshish ka sahaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada<br> <br> zulme duniya khamoshi se ai abad<br> kar gayi kaise gawaara sayyada<br> mustafa ke dilka paara sayyada</span></span></p> 
